# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# SmolTV-Pro - source control scope
#
# Tracked: the firmware source and the tooling/docs needed to REPRODUCE it.
#   src/  include/  lib/  platformio.ini  partitions.csv  README.md
#   docs/  scripts/          (new, root-level - build/test/generative only)
#
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

re/

# -- Local-only notes and decision records ------------------------------------
# Kept on disk, never committed.
CONTEXT.md
docs/adr/

# -- Agent / editor local config ----------------------------------------------
CLAUDE.md
.claude/
.mcp.json
.vscode/
.idea/

# -- PlatformIO build output --------------------------------------------------
.pio/
.pioenvs/
.piolibdeps/
*.elf
*.bin
*.hex
*.map

# -- Python -------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# -- Node. Not needed to build or to regenerate assets; lv_font_conv is only used
# -- by scripts/lv_font_gen_verify.py, to check our converter against it. --------
node_modules/
package-lock.json

# -- Fetched upstream assets --------------------------------------------------
# The asset pipeline downloads fonts and icon sets from upstream. Those are
# third-party files with their own licences: cache them locally, never commit
# them. Only the generated headers they produce are tracked.
assets/cache/
assets/fetched/
# Intermediates the pipeline writes on its way to the generated headers: instanced fonts,
# rasterised PNGs, per-face .c files, contact sheets. All reproducible from the cache, and
# ~3 MB of them, so only the headers they produce are tracked.
assets/build/
scripts/captures/

# The LittleFS image source, assembled by scripts/pack_fs.py from assets/build/ (generated)
# and assets/cache/stock/ (captured from a stock unit). Every file in it is a copy of
# something produced elsewhere, and it additionally holds vendor-authored web UI files that
# should not enter this repository. Never edit data/ by hand -- change pack_fs.py's LAYOUT.
data/

# -- Generated, but DELIBERATELY TRACKED --------------------------------------
# src/LvFontsGen.h and src/LvImagesGen.h are machine-generated yet committed on
# purpose, so the firmware builds offline without running a network-dependent
# fetch/convert pipeline. Do not add them here.

# -- OS noise -----------------------------------------------------------------
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
.DS_Store
._*
*.swp
*~

# -- Stray logs / scratch -----------------------------------------------------
*.log

# Editor/backup leftovers
*.bak
*.orig
*.rej

# clangd compilation database. Machine-specific absolute paths, regenerated with
# `pio run -t compiledb`, so it is never committed.
compile_commands.json
